OL,3,GNEWSAThree arrested after one-year-old
OL,4,Ataken to hospital
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman, 26, and man, 25, from Ryde,
OL,7,Fand a 26-year-old man from Shanklin
OL,8,Fwere arrested on suspicion of causing
OL,9,Fgrievous bodily harm. The pair from
OL,10,FRyde were also held on suspicion of
OL,11,Fassault and ill-treatment or neglect of
OL,12,Fa child likely to cause unnecessary
OL,13,Fsuffering or injury.
OL,15,FThe force said all three had been
OL,16,Fbailed until 26 November with strict
OL,17,Fconditions whilst inquiries "into the
OL,18,Fmatter were ongoing".
